S HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES. [CLICK HERE FOR INFORMATION ABOUT JOINING THE...'}{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2022-05-31 09:17:00', 'title': 'TYLER TECHNOLOGIES ACQUIRES QUATRED', 'text': 'PLANO, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $TYL #TYLERTECH--TYLER TECHNOLOGIES ANNOUNCED IT HAS ACQUIRED QUATRED, A SYSTEMS INTEGRATOR THAT ASSISTS CLIENTS WITH IMPLEMENTING ADVANCED TOUCHLESS TECHNOLOGIES.'}{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION EXECUTIVES TO ADDRESS THE UBS GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS AND TRANSPORTATION CONFERENCE', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB. , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIFER HAMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AND KENNY ROCKER, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT – MARKETING AND SALES, OF UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP), WILL ADDRESS THE UBS GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS AND TRANSPORTATION CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, JUNE 7, 2022, AT 8:00 A.M.'}{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2022-05-31 09:00:00', 'title': "HDI GLOBAL LEVERAGES VERISK'S MOZART FORM COMPOSER® TO STREAMLINE FORMS MANAGEMENT", 'text': 'JERSEY CITY, N.J., MAY 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INDUSTRIAL INSURER HDI GLOBAL INSURANCE COMPANY (HDI) WILL BE LEVERAGING THE CLOUD-BASED TECHNOLOGY AND ADVANCED ANALYTICS OF VERISK (NASDAQ: VRSK), A LEADING GLOBAL DATA ANALYTICS PROVIDER, TO HELP INCREASE EFFICIENCY AND DEVELOP INNOVATIVE INSURANCE PRODUCTS.'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2022-05-31 13:31:00', 'title': 'VERIZON CUSTOMERS WIN BIG, USING MORE THAN 17 TB OF DATA AT THE INDIANAPOLIS 500', 'text': "NEW YORK, MAY 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARCUS ERICSSON MAY HAVE WON THE 106TH RUNNING OF THE INDIANAPOLIS 500, BUT VERIZON CUSTOMERS ALSO HAD A LOT TO CHEER ABOUT AT THE RACING CAPITAL OF THE WORLD. MORE THAN 325,000 PEOPLE GATHERED AT THE INDIANAPOLIS MOTOR SPEEDWAY (IMS) ON SUNDAY, AND VERIZON CUSTOMERS WERE WELL REPRESENTED AND WELL TAKEN CARE OF – USING MORE THAN 17 TERABYTES OF DATA ON RACE DAY. THAT'S MORE THAN THE 15 TERABYTES OF D